OL,3,GNEWSAFarm worker jailed for single
OL,4,Apunch killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farm labourer has been jailed for
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after killing a man with a
OL,8,Fsingle punch in a Suffolk village.
OL,10,FUmidbek Akhmedov, 31, of Summer Lane in
OL,11,FBromeswell, near Woodbridge, had
OL,12,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to killing
OL,13,FZoirbek Odamboev.
OL,15,FIpswich Crown Court heard that both men
OL,16,Fhad been staying in caravans in
OL,17,FBromeswell and had been drinking vodka
OL,18,Fon 28 August before Akhmedov was seen
OL,19,Fon CCTV punching Odamboev, who fell
OL,20,Fback and hit his head on the ground.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
